{"messages":[{"text":"🇫🇷 Macron cae al 16% de opiniones favorables, un nuevo mínimo en un sondeo publicado este domingo.\n🌶️ A Macron ya le queda más aprobación en Bruselas que en Francia.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AB%F0%9F%87%B7%20Macron%20cae%20al%2016%25%20de%20opiniones%20favorables%2C%20un%20nuevo%20m%C3%ADnimo%20en%20un%20sondeo%20publicado%20este%20domingo.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20A%20Macron%20ya%20le%20queda%20m%C3%A1s%20aprobaci%C3%B3n%20en%20Bruselas%20que%20en%20Francia."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AB%F0%9F%87%B7%20Macron%20cae%20al%2016%25%20de%20opiniones%20favorables%2C%20un%20nuevo%20m%C3%ADnimo%20en%20un%20sondeo%20publicado%20este%20domingo.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Macron%20toca%20el%2016%25%3A%20el%20centro%20pol%C3%ADtico%20empieza%20a%20parecer%20una%20mesa%20para%20uno."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AB%F0%9F%87%B7%20Macron%20cae%20al%2016%25%20de%20opiniones%20favorables%2C%20un%20nuevo%20m%C3%ADnimo%20en%20un%20sondeo%20publicado%20este%20domingo.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Con%20un%2016%25%2C%20Macron%20ya%20no%20busca%20remontada%3A%20busca%20testigos."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AB%F0%9F%87%B7%20Macron%20cae%20al%2016%25%20de%20opiniones%20favorables%2C%20un%20nuevo%20m%C3%ADnimo%20en%20un%20sondeo%20publicado%20este%20domingo.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Macron%20cae%20al%2016%25.%20La%20grandeur%2C%20de%20momento%2C%20cabe%20en%20un%20margen%20de%20error."}],"search_terms":["Macron","16%","Francia"]},{"text":"🏎️ Felipe VI acude al Gran Premio de España de F1 en Madring, acompañado por la princesa Leonor y la infanta Sofía.\n🌶️ Madring ya tiene rey, herederas y paddock: solo faltaba declarar la curva patrimonio nacional.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%